rem Cubic Permutations
rem https://projecteuler.net/problem=62
rem Smallest cube with exactly five cube
rem permutations of its digits

use algo
use sequences
use io
use cli

option Perms integer = 5

rem Count cubes by their sorted digits.
Cubes = (1 to 10000) ** 3 array
Keys = Cubes text rank 0 sort rank 0
Seen = new counter Keys
Mask = Seen Keys equal Perms
Answer = (Cubes Mask) first
Answer print
